      <title>PSLM 0.1.1</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Sep 2026 09:31:22 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>0.1.1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h3>PSLM 0.1.1</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Lower peak memory in the full mastering chain — more headroom on long / heavy tracks.</li>
          <li>Audio-thread safety guard in the A/B preview.</li>
          <li>Internal fixes. No change to the mastering sound.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
